# The CRLF fixture IS its line endings: it proves mozart-lint.sh's conductor
# parser strips \r so a CRLF-encoded state file lints identically to an LF one.
# -text keeps git from normalising it on checkout; -whitespace keeps
# `git diff --check` from reporting its 28 carriage returns as trailing
# whitespace (F51). It cannot tell a deliberate \r from a stray one, and the
# rest of the fixture corpus was cleaned rather than exempted, so this is the
# only path in the repo that opts out.
tests/fixtures/conductor/lint/.mozart/plans/active/2099-07-24-deliver-crlf.state.md -text -whitespace
